 "text": "Oh, we don't think of it as rent. Everything you build, you'll build on our servers, as many as you like, for as long as you like. We'll keep the lights on and the floors warm. You keep doing whatever it is you do upstairs at night.",
 "spoken_as": "Oh, we don't think of it as rent.{s0.6} Everything you build, you'll build on our servers,{0.25} as many as you like,{0.2} for as long as you like.{s0.6} We'll keep the lights on and the floors warm.{s0.55} You keep doing whatever it is you do upstairs at night.",
